{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1129423-pugmire-and-cavaliers-of-mars-at-gen-con-50","id":1129423,"title":"Pugmire and Cavaliers of Mars at Gen Con 50!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Cavaliers of Mars"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-15T14:15:08-07:00","id":1129423,"title":"Pugmire and Cavaliers of Mars at Gen Con 50!","content":"Hi! Here's what we're up to for <i>Pugmire</i> and <i>Cavaliers of Mars</i> at Gen Con 50.<br /> <br /> <b>Panel</b><br /> <br /> On Friday, at 1 PM, at the Crowne Plaza hotel, in Victoria Station A, we'll be hosting a panel for <i>Cavaliers of Mars</i>, <i>Pugmire</i>, <i>Monarchies of Mau</i>, and the <i>Scarred Lands</i>. Eddy and I will be on hand to talk about upcoming games and answer questions.<br /> <br /> <b>Booth</b><br /> <br /> At the booth (#501), we'll be running demos of <i>Cavaliers</i> and <i>Pugmire</i>. Stop by on Sunday to play a demo with me!<br /> <br /> We'll also be selling physical copies of <i>Pugmire</i> to the general public for the first time, and will have print copies of <i>Monarchies of Mau Early Access</i>.<br /> <br /> Finally, I'll have the complete manuscript of <i>Cavaliers</i> available for you to peruse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 08-15-2017, 05:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions"